1.  RUNNING SUM OF 1D ARRAY
-------------------------------------------

Q1. Given an array nums. We define a running sum of an array as runningSum[i] = sum(nums[0]…nums[i]).
Return the running sum of nums.

Sol. 
class Solution {
    public int[] runningSum(int[] nums) {
        int n = nums.length ;
        int[] newArr = new int[n];
        
        int ans = 0 ;

        for(int i = 0 ; i < n ; i++){
            ans = ans + nums[i];
            newArr[i] = ans ;
        }
        return newArr;
    }
}
